flowchart TD
  A([Scheduled check, Check now or Archive replay]) --> Q[Queue run and serialize per AOI]
  Q --> S[Search real catalogue]
  S --> P{Provider succeeds?}
  P -- No --> FAIL[Record failure and scheduler backoff]
  P -- Yes --> NEW{New usable later scene and older baseline?}
  NEW -- No --> NONE[Record no-new or no-suitable scene]
  NEW -- Yes --> REF[Seek previous-year same-season reference]
  REF --> PRE[Read aligned bands and mask poor pixels]
  PRE --> DET[Change model plus spectral evidence or labelled fallback]
  DET --> CH{Retained change regions?}
  CH -- No --> NOCH[Store analysis with no significant change]
  CH -- Yes --> CAUSE[Land-cover transitions and optional context rules]
  CAUSE --> SEAS[Same-season test: true, false or unknown]
  SEAS --> BEN{Seasonal recurrence or crop cycle?}
  BEN -- Yes --> STORE[Store benign finding without alert]
  BEN -- No --> AUTH[Check applicable registered zone; assign verdict and reasons]
  AUTH --> EL{Evidence score and category eligible?}
  EL -- No --> KEEP[Store finding without alert]
  EL -- Yes --> DUP{Overlap with compatible active alert?}
  DUP -- Yes --> MERGE[Update persistence; retain evidence]
  DUP -- No --> DIS[Create alert and route department inbox]
  DIS --> SMTP[SMTP outcome or saved unsent email as applicable]
  SMTP --> REVIEW[Human acknowledgement, field verification and outcome]
  FAIL --> END([Retain state and evidence])
  NONE --> END
  NOCH --> END
  STORE --> END
  KEEP --> END
  MERGE --> END
  REVIEW --> END
